    description: 'Berlin AI Film Festival 2026 returns for its 2nd edition February 9-11, 2027, with submissions open on FilmFreeway until December 31, 2026 (entry fees $10-$40). This guide covers BAIFF 2nd Edition, the urgent Forward Festival Berlin AI Shortest Film Competition by LTX Studio (deadline June 28, 2026, $3,000 prize, free entry), eligibility, categories, jury approach, and how to plan a Berlin AI film run.',
